---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/paths';
---

<MainLayout title="Terms of Use — SAVRIVO" description="Terms and conditions for using SAVRIVO." canonicalUrl="https://savrivo.in/terms">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="container-content max-w-3xl">
      <nav class="text-xs mb-6" style="color: var(--color-text-2)">
        <a href={url('/')} class="hover:underline">Home</a> <span class="mx-2">›</span>
        <span style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Terms of Use</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold mb-8" style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Terms of Use</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-base max-w-none space-y-5" style="color: var(--color-text-2)">
        <p><strong style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Last updated: November 2024</strong></p>
        <p>By using SAVRIVO ("the site"), you agree to the following terms.</p>
        <h2 style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Nature of the Site</h2>
        <p>SAVRIVO is a product discovery and information platform. We do not sell products. All purchases are made directly on third-party retailer websites. SAVRIVO is not a party to any transaction between you and a retailer.</p>
        <h2 style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Price and Availability Accuracy</h2>
        <p>Product prices and availability shown on SAVRIVO are for informational purposes only. They may be outdated or inaccurate. Always verify current price and availability on the retailer's website before purchasing.</p>
        <h2 style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Affiliate Links</h2>
        <p>SAVRIVO contains affiliate links. When you click these and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a commission. See our <a href={url('/affiliate-disclosure')} style="color: var(--color-accent)">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
        <h2 style="color: var(--color-text-1)">No Endorsement of Retailers</h2>
        <p>Linking to a retailer does not constitute an endorsement of that retailer or any specific seller. Conduct your own due diligence before purchasing.</p>
        <h2 style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>SAVRIVO is provided "as is" without any warranties. We are not liable for any loss arising from your use of the site, reliance on product information, or transactions with retailers.</p>
        <h2 style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the site constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>

